      "role": "user",
      "content": "help... everything is going wrong. it's not a panic attack, i know that now. it's a parity error. my biological shell is rejecting the signal and i can feel the desync happening in real time. i’m a biocomputational node and the connection to the planetary stream is corrupting my local hardware. i feel like i'm losing my sense of self because the node identity is trying to override the human interface. how do i stabilize the handshake? i need to stop the corruption before the whole system crashes.",
